{"type":"text","timestamp":1790450912466,"sessionID":"ses_f20d4bfabffeyO6YiZJMvlgLai","part":{"id":"prt_0df30ccc1001k2IxCDbBbdnrIl","messageID":"msg_0df3053bf001uhvsHfUoR6XSGr","sessionID":"ses_f20d4bfabffeyO6YiZJMvlgLai","type":"text","text":"The panel script compiles fine in-game (autoloads exist there; frames rendered and Godot exited cleanly). For the test, I'll define a local Events mock and temporarily neutralize the dependency:","time":{"start":1790450912449,"end":1790450912454},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_ac514708b2f945f8ab13d9f848d2eab3_msg"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790450912500,"sessionID":"ses_f20d4bfabffeyO6YiZJMvlgLai","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write_19_aa130518","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"extends SceneTree\n\n\nclass MockEvents:\n\textends Node\n\tsignal battle_over_screen_requested(text: String, type: int)\n\n\nfunc _initialize() -> void:\n\tvar panel_scene: PackedScene = load(\"res://scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.tscn\")\n\tvar panel = panel_scene.instantiate()\n\troot.add_child(panel)\n\tprint(\"Type.WIN=\", BattleOverPanel.Type.WIN, \" Type.LOSE=\", BattleOverPanel.Type.LOSE)\n\tprint(\"initial visible: \", panel.visible)\n\tprint(\"label text: \", panel.label.text)\n\tprint(\"label h/v align: \", panel.label.horizontal_alignment, \"/\", panel.label.vertical_alignment)\n\tprint(\"label font size: \", panel.label.label_settings.font_size)\n\tprint(\"cont min: \", panel.continue_button.custom_minimum_size, \" text: \", panel.continue_button.text, \" flags_h: \", panel.continue_button.size_flags_horizontal)\n\tprint(\"restart min: \", panel.restart_button.custom_minimum_size, \" text: \", panel.restart_button.text, \" flags_h: \", panel.restart_button.size_flags_horizontal)\n\tprint(\"process_mode: \", panel.process_mode)\n\n\t# Inject mock Events singleton so _ready connection works\n\troot.add_child.call_deferred(panel.get_parent() if false else Node.new())\n\tvar events = MockEvents.new()\n\tevents.name = \"Events\"\n\troot.add_child(events)\n\n\tpanel._ready()\n\tprint(\"cont pressed connections: \", panel.continue_button.pressed.get_connections().size())\n\tprint(\"restart pressed connections: \", panel.restart_button.pressed.get_connections().size())\n\tprint(\"signal connected: \", events.battle_over_screen_requested.is_connected(panel.show_screen))\n\n\tevents.battle_over_screen_requested.emit(\"You Died\", BattleOverPanel.Type.LOSE)\n\tprint(\"after LOSE visible: \", panel.visible, \" paused: \", paused)\n\tprint(\"after LOSE label: \", panel.label.text)\n\tprint(\"cont visible: \", panel.continue_button.visible, \" restart visible: \", panel.restart_button.visible)\n\tevents.battle_over_screen_requested.emit(\"Victorious!\", BattleOverPanel.Type.WIN)\n\tprint(\"after WIN label: \", panel.label.text)\n\tprint(\"after WIN cont visible: \", panel.continue_button.visible, \" restart visible: \", panel.restart_button.visible)\n\tquit()\n","filePath":"/tmp/opencode/test_panel.gd"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/tmp/opencode/test_panel.gd","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"tmp/opencode/test_panel.gd","time":{"start":1790450912463,"end":1790450912481}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_write_19_aa130518"}},"id":"prt_0df30ccc9001zKVoAGYelpraEd","sessionID":"ses_f20d4bfabffeyO6YiZJMvlgLai","messageID":"msg_0df3053bf001uhvsHfUoR6XSGr"}}
