{"type":"text","timestamp":1790451082886,"sessionID":"ses_f20d4bfabffeyO6YiZJMvlgLai","part":{"id":"prt_0df33666f0017FRMgedUp3EsQh","messageID":"msg_0df32d359001cKxxKlzx3t5v2P","sessionID":"ses_f20d4bfabffeyO6YiZJMvlgLai","type":"text","text":"The task is complete. Summary of what was done:\n\n## Created Files\n\n**`res://scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.tscn`** — Panel UI scene with:\n- Root `Panel` named `BattleOverPanel` with `process_mode = 3` (Always) and full-rect anchors (`anchors_preset = 15`, stretching to entire window)\n- `theme_override_styles/panel` set to a `StyleBoxFlat` with `bg_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 0.34902)`\n- A centered `VBoxContainer` (center anchor preset, offsets −20/−20/20/20, `alignment = 1`)\n- Inside it:\n  - `Label` (unique name) — text `\"Victorious!\"`, centered horizontal (`1`) and vertical (`1`) alignment, `LabelSettings` with `font_size = 24`\n  - `ContinueButton` (unique name) — `custom_minimum_size (50, 16)`, `size_flags_horizontal = 3` (expand fill), text `\"Awesome!\"`\n  - `RestartButton` (unique name) — same size/flags, text `\"Restart\"`\n\n**`res://scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.gd`** — Script with:\n- `class_name BattleOverPanel`, `extends Panel`\n- `enum Type {WIN, LOSE}`\n- `%Label`, `%ContinueButton`, `%RestartButton` bindings via `@onready`\n- `_ready()` connects `ContinueButton` → `get_tree().quit`, `RestartButton` → `get_tree().reload_current_scene`, and `Events.battle_over_screen_requested` → `show_screen`\n- `show_screen(text, type)` updates label text, shows `ContinueButton` only for `WIN`, `RestartButton` only for `LOSE`, calls `show()`, and pauses the tree\n\n## Verification\n- ✅ Headless project import — no errors\n- ✅ Rendered frame via `--write-movie` — panel displays fullscreen with centered dark box and visible label/buttons\n- ✅ Functional test: enum values, node bindings, both button connections, and `show_screen` behavior verified for both WIN and LOSE (label updates, correct button visibility, `paused = true`)\n- ✅ End-to-end test with the real `Events` autoload: emitting `battle_over_screen_requested` correctly drives the panel in game mode\n- ✅ All temporary test artifacts removed; `main.tscn` restored to its original state","time":{"start":1790451082863,"end":1790451082868},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_feb26488ba4a4089b0fd3aa974bafa52_msg"}}}}
